sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor RecipientDevice as Offline Recipient Device
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    RecipientDevice->>API: Connect WSS / Reconnect HTTP
    RecipientDevice->>API: GET /api/v1/conversations/:id/envelopes/pending
    API->>DB: SELECT pending envelopes for deviceId
    DB-->>API: Return unexpired pending envelopes
    API-->>RecipientDevice: 200 OK (List of Envelopes)
    RecipientDevice->>API: Batch POST /api/v1/envelopes/:id/delivered
